    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The connection between the Cockerham-Weir and Comstock-Robinson models can be seen by setting $ d_{j} = n_{j} + m_{j}, s_{i} = n_{i} + p_{i} $, and $ I_{ij} = t_{ij} + k_{ij} $ in Equation 20.1a. It follows that",
