    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "These equivalencies reveal two hidden assumptions in the Comstock-Robinson model — an absence of paternal extranuclear effects ( $ \\sigma_{p}^{2}=0 $), and an absence of any interaction effects involving extranuclear factors ( $ \\sigma_{k}^{2}=0 $).",
