    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The complete layout for the observed and expected mean squares and cross-products for Design II with reciprocals is given in Table 20.3, the top part of which is a simple extension of Table 20.1. Estimates of the Comstock-Robinson variance-covariance components, and hence of the Cockerham-Weir parameters, are obtainable by the method of moments (equating the observed mean squares and cross-products to their expectations). Interpretations of both sets of variance-covariance components in terms of covariances between relatives are summarized in Table 20.2.",
